OL,5,G1900 Ghost Chapel
OL,6,     FThis Halloween, join Carys Eleri
OL,7,     Fat Carmarthen's Museum of the
OL,8,     FParanormal. Hear a real seance,
OL,9,     Fcursed artefacts, Victorian
OL,10,     Ftable-tipping, and spirits
OL,11,     Freaching out from beyond.
