OL,5,G2000 Aberfan 60
OL,6,     FThe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,7,     FWales and conductor Timothy
OL,8,     FRedmond mark the 60 years since
OL,9,     Fthe Aberfan disaster with a new
OL,10,     Fcommission by Paul Mealor - From
OL,11,     FDarkness into Light.
OL,12,G2140 Beverley's World of Music
OL,13,     FThe finest musical melodies,
OL,14,     Fexquisite performances from stage
OL,15,     Fand screen, and orchestral and
OL,16,     Fchoral works from Wales and the
OL,17,     Fworld. There's no need to book
OL,18,     Fyour seat, just listen and relax.
